  "practice": [
    "Say ঘ three times with extra air: ghô, ghô, ghô.",
    "Practice the vowel forms: ঘ (ghô), ঘা (gha), ঘি (ghi), ঘী (ghi, rare), ঘু (ghu), ঘূ (ghu), ঘে (ghe), ঘৈ (ghoi, rare), ঘো (gho), and ঘৌ (ghou, rare).",
    "Read the combinations aloud: ঘ + া = ঘা as in ঘাম, ঘ + ি = ঘি, ঘ + ু = ঘু as in ঘুম, ঘ + ে = ঘে as in ঘেরা, and ঘ + ো = ঘো as in ঘোড়া.",
    "Compare গ (g) with ঘ (gh, extra air): গান / ঘর, গাছ / ঘুম, and গাড়ি / ঘড়ি.",
    "Use ঘর, ঘরে, ঘড়ি, ঘুম, ঘাম, ঘাস, ঘোড়া, and ঘটনা as quick reading anchors.",
    "Recognize these phrases instantly: আমি ঘরে আছি, আমার ঘুম পাচ্ছে, আমি ঘুমাতে চাই, এক ঘণ্টা, and কী ঘটেছে."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "ঘ is a common Bangla consonant named ghô. It is the aspirated partner of গ and is pronounced with extra air.",
    "The vowel-sign forms include ঘ (ghô), ঘা (gha), ঘি (ghi), ঘী (ghi), ঘু (ghu), ঘূ (ghu), ঘে (ghe), ঘৈ (ghoi), ঘো (gho), and ঘৌ (ghou). Examples include ঘর, ঘাম, ঘি, ঘুম, ঘূর্ণি, ঘেরা, and ঘোড়া.",
    "Compare গান (gan, song), গাছ (gachh, tree), and গাড়ি (gari, car) with ঘর (ghor, room), ঘুম (ghum, sleep), ঘড়ি (ghori, clock/watch), and ঘোড়া (ghora, horse).",
    "Best words to memorize include ঘর, ঘরে, ঘড়ি, ঘণ্টা, ঘুম, ঘুমানো, ঘাম, ঘাড়, ঘাস, ঘুড়ি, ঘোড়া, ঘটনা, ঘটা, ঘোরা, ঘুরতে, ঘনঘন, and ঘূর্ণিঝড়."
